    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "1f5d39e60ac44bcea33e3c49b4d4721e",
    "m_Title": "Composite Normals",
    "m_Content": "We use a keyword to decide whether or not to use the smooth normals or the hard normals. To prevent normals from looking discontinuous at hard edges, we take the absolute value of the curvature and use it to blend between the transformed detail normal and either the smooth or hard normal. ",
