    "m_Title": "Apply Gradient",
    "m_Content": "For opaque objects, B2U gives the option to paint a gradient onto the surface. We need to check if the object is opaque and multiply our detail heightmap by this gradient so it can be used to lerp between the base color and emission color or black.",
